# Content Markdown

## Blog Post (`src/blog/YYYY/MM/DD/slug.md`)
Required frontmatter: `tags: blogs`, `layout: markdown.hbs`, `title`, `shortTitle`, `tldr`, `cardDate`.
File path sets the URL. Write body as standard Markdown below frontmatter.

## Note (`src/notes/NNN-slug.md`)
Required frontmatter: `tags: notes`, `title`, `date`.
Prefix filename with zero-padded number for ordering. Body renders inline on `/notes/` — no detail page.

## About / Markdown Pages
Use `layout: markdown.hbs` and `title` in frontmatter. Body wrapped in DaisyUI `prose` classes automatically.

## CV (`src/_content/cv/content.md`)
Raw markdown only — no frontmatter. Pulled in by CV page via `markdown-to-html` shortcode. Excluded from 11ty processing.
